OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, charged with attempted
OL,4,Amurder over city centre stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy has been charged with
OL,7,Fattempted murder after a man was
OL,8,Fseriously injured in a stabbing in
OL,9,FLiverpool city centre.
OL,11,FMerseyside Police said officers were
OL,12,Fcalled to Chavasse Park just after
OL,13,F21:00 GMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe 18-year-old victim required
OL,16,Fhospital treatment and remains in a
OL,17,Fstable condition.
