OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, charged with attempted
OL,4,Amurder over city centre stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy from Wavertree, who
OL,7,Fcannot be named for legal reasons, has
OL,8,Fbeen charged with attempted murder and
OL,9,Fpossession of a bladed article in a
OL,10,Fpublic place. He has been remanded into
OL,11,Fcustody and is due to appear at
OL,12,FMerseyside Youth Court later.
